<p>	  (Results in thousands except per share figures)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 and year loss reflect start-up and expansion of negative electrode production equipment and battery pack production; additional technical, manufacturing and engineering support for the GM Ovonic L.L.C. manufacturing joint venture as it prepares for initial nickel metal hydride (NiMH) battery production and support of Honda and other customers; ongoing electric vehicle battery research and development with reduced revenues from funded R&amp;D programs; and ongoing defense of the company's battery technology patents.</p>
<p>Energy Conversion Devices Inc is the company's full name.</p>
